---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Great Gus Productions" description="Read the Great Gus Productions privacy policy covering contact forms, checkout processing, Printful fulfillment, cookies, and limited data collection practices.">
  <section class="legal-page">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: March 12, 2026</p>

    <div class="legal-content">
      <h2>Type of Information We Collect</h2>
<p>
GREAT GUS PRODUCTIONS LLC may collect personal information you voluntarily provide,
including your name, email address, and message content when you contact us.
      We may also collect limited technical information such as browser type, device information,
      and basic site activity needed to operate, secure, and improve the website.
</p>

<h2>How We Collect Information</h2>
<p>
Information is collected when you submit forms, send messages through our website,
or interact with site features. Payment transactions are handled entirely by
third-party providers and are not stored on our servers.
</p>

<h2>Contact Forms</h2>
<p>
If you submit the contact form on this website, we may collect your name,
email address, and the message content you provide.
</p>
<p>
Contact form submissions are processed through Netlify Forms and are used only
to respond to inquiries and provide customer support.
</p>
<p>
We retain contact form submissions only for as long as reasonably necessary to
respond to your inquiry, maintain business records, and comply with legal obligations.
</p>
<p>
We do not sell, rent, or share contact information submitted through the contact
form for marketing purposes.
</p>

<h2>Cart & Browser Storage</h2>
<p>
If you add merchandise to your cart, this website may store cart information in your browser
using local storage so your selected items remain available while you continue shopping.
Cart information may remain in your browser until you remove the item, clear your cart,
clear your browser storage, or proceed through checkout.
</p>

<h2>Orders, Checkout & Fulfillment</h2>
<p>
If you place a merchandise order, your checkout and payment information is processed securely by Stripe.
To fulfill and ship your order, order details such as your name, shipping address, email address,
phone number if provided, and purchased items may be shared with our fulfillment partner, Printful.
If an order encounters a fulfillment or processing issue that requires internal review,
limited order details may also be transmitted through Resend so we can receive an operational alert and respond.
GREAT GUS PRODUCTIONS LLC does not store full payment card information.
</p>

<h2>Cookies, Analytics & Marketing Tools</h2>
<p>
We do not currently use first-party advertising cookies, Meta Pixel, Google Analytics,
email marketing tracking, newsletter tracking, or similar marketing technologies on this website.
If our services or legal obligations ever require us to implement such tools in the future,
we will update this Privacy Policy and handle any related information with reasonable security measures.
</p>
<p>
Some third-party services used by this website, such as Stripe, Printful, Resend, Vimeo OTT, YouTube embeds,
or hosted fonts and media providers, may collect technical information or use their own cookies or similar technologies
subject to their own privacy policies and platform terms.
</p>

<h2>Why We Collect Information</h2>
<ul>
  <li>To respond to inquiries and provide customer support</li>
  <li>To operate and improve our website and services</li>
  <li>To comply with legal obligations</li>
</ul>

<h2>Payments & Third-Party Services</h2>
<p>
All merchandise purchases are processed through Stripe and fulfilled by Printful.
Film streaming and digital access may be provided through Vimeo OTT.
GREAT GUS PRODUCTIONS LLC does not store credit card numbers or payment credentials.
</p>

<h2>We Do Not Sell Personal Information</h2>
<p>
GREAT GUS PRODUCTIONS LLC does not sell, rent, trade, or share personal information
for monetary or commercial purposes.
</p>
<p>
For transparency, we provide a separate
<a href="/we-do-not-sell/">We Do Not Sell Personal Information</a>
page that explains this practice directly.
No opt-out mechanism is required because we do not sell personal data.
</p>

<h2>Data Security</h2>
<p>
We take reasonable measures to protect personal information but cannot guarantee
absolute security. You provide information at your own risk.
</p>

<h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p>
This Privacy Policy may be updated periodically. Any changes will be posted on this page.
</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>
GREAT GUS PRODUCTIONS LLC<br />
Washington State<br />
<a href="mailto:greatgusproductions@gmail.com">
greatgusproductions@gmail.com
</a>
</p>

<h2>Copyright</h2>
<p>
© 2018–2026 GREAT GUS PRODUCTIONS LLC. All Rights Reserved.
</p>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 1rem 6rem;
  }

  .legal-page h1 {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  .last-updated {
    margin-top: -2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    text-align: left;
    color: #bdbdbd;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .legal-content h2 {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .legal-content p,
  .legal-content li {
    color: #e6e6e6;
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .legal-content ul {
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
  }
</style>
